 explicitly unspecified rather than guessed at. Add a LICENSE file to the
 repository and update this stanza before distributing the package outside
 the organisation.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------
This package vendors a Python interpreter, a set of Python distributions,
several shared libraries and four model files. Their licences are reproduced
in the components' own metadata inside the package; the summary below is for
orientation and is not a substitute for those files.

Files: opt/gideon/python/*
Copyright: Python Software Foundation and contributors
License: PSF-2.0
 A python-build-standalone CPython 3.12 distribution, including its bundled
 Tcl/Tk and OpenSSL. Per-component licences ship under
 /opt/gideon/python/share/ and the interpreter's own LICENSE file.

Files: opt/gideon/python/lib/python3.12/site-packages/*
Copyright: the respective upstream authors
License: various
 51 Python distributions installed from their published wheels. Each carries
 its own metadata (and, where the project provides one, its LICENSE file) in
 the adjacent *.dist-info directory. The major ones are:
   torch, torchaudio           BSD-3-Clause
   numpy, scipy, scikit-learn  BSD-3-Clause
   onnxruntime                 MIT
   ctranslate2, faster-whisper MIT
   openwakeword                Apache-2.0
   piper-tts                   MIT
   silero-vad                  MIT
   sounddevice                 MIT
   pystray                     LGPL-3.0
   Pillow                      MIT-CMU
   requests, PyYAML            Apache-2.0 / MIT

Files: opt/gideon/native/*, opt/gideon/typelib/*
Copyright: the respective upstream authors
License: various
 Shared libraries and a GObject-Introspection typelib extracted unmodified
 from Ubuntu 24.04 binary packages:
   libportaudio.so.2           MIT              (libportaudio2)
   libjack.so.0                LGPL-2.1+        (libjack-jackd2-0)
   libdb-5.3.so                Sleepycat        (libdb5.3t64)
   libayatana-appindicator3    LGPL-3.0/LGPL-2.1 (libayatana-appindicator3-1)
   libayatana-indicator3       LGPL-3.0/LGPL-2.1 (libayatana-indicator3-7)
   libayatana-ido3             LGPL-3.0/LGPL-2.1 (libayatana-ido3-0.4-0)
   libdbusmenu-glib/-gtk3      LGPL-2.1/LGPL-3.0 (libdbusmenu-glib4, -gtk3-4)
   AyatanaAppIndicator3-0.1    LGPL-3.0/LGPL-2.1 (gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1)
 The corresponding source is available from the Ubuntu archive
 (`apt-get source <package>`) for each of the versions listed in
 /usr/share/doc/gideon/BUILD.md.

Files: opt/gideon/models/whisper/*
Copyright: OpenAI; CTranslate2 conversion by Systran
License: MIT
 Whisper "small", converted to CTranslate2 format, redistributed from the
 Hugging Face repository Systran/faster-whisper-small.

Files: opt/gideon/models/piper/*
Copyright: Rhasspy / Piper contributors; Lessac Technologies (source corpus)
License: SEE-UPSTREAM
 Piper voice en_US-lessac-high, redistributed from the Hugging Face
 repository rhasspy/piper-voices. The voice's own .onnx.json carries no
 licence field, so the terms are those stated by that repository for the
 Lessac dataset. Confirm them upstream before redistributing this package
 externally.

Files: opt/gideon/models/openwakeword/*
Copyright: David Scripka
License: Apache-2.0
 openWakeWord's shared melspectrogram and embedding feature extractors,
 redistributed from the openWakeWord v0.5.1 release assets.

Files: opt/gideon/models/wake_word/hey_gideon.onnx
Copyright: Ankit Chhetri
License: UNSPECIFIED
 Trained for this project with openWakeWord's training pipeline
 (modules/02-wake-word/training/). Same caveat as the project source above.
